      "notes": "Antak (Nishang) is an ASP.NET webshell with a PowerShell console UI - good on IIS/.NET targets. Upload where the app allows aspx, then run PowerShell straight from the browser. Antak is part of Nishang (samratashok). Located at /usr/share/nishang/Antak-WebShell/antak.aspx on Kali/Pwnbox. Must edit line 14 for creds before deploying. Provides upload/download, PowerShell execution, and encoded-command evasion. Also covered in: CPTS Ch08.",
