      "notes": "Write the command reversed so the blacklisted keyword never appears literally, then reverse it back at runtime with rev (Linux) or [-1..-N] -join '' (PowerShell). Also covered in: OSCP PEN-200 Chapter 9 (Common Web Application Attacks).",
