        "prerequisites": "A web application passes user-controlled input to a system shell function (PHP: system/exec/shell_exec/passthru/popen, Node.js: child_process.exec, Python: os.system/subprocess with shell=True) without input validation or sanitization. The injected command runs with the web server process privileges (www-data on Linux, SYSTEM on Windows in misconfigured setups).",
