        "why_it_works": "Exploits a path-traversal vulnerability in CoreFTP Server (unsanitised PUT path) to write files outside the FTP root - e.g. a web shell or startup script.",
        "prerequisites": "Network access to a vulnerable CoreFTP Server and (often) valid FTP creds.",
