        "detection": "POST request to /user/register or Drupal forms with '#' prefixed parameters. IDS signature for CVE-2018-7600 payload pattern.",
        "artifacts": "Web server access log (POST to /user/register with exploit payload) | IDS alert for Drupalgeddon2 signature | New .php file created by web server process",
        "prevention": "Update to Drupal 7.58 / 8.5.1 or later immediately. Enable automated security update notifications. Apply WAF rules with CVE-2018-7600 signatures.",
