      "name": "Email - Password Attack (POP3/IMAP/SMTP)",
      "command": "hydra -L users.txt -p '<password>' -f <ip> pop3",
      "description": "Password guessing against mailbox protocols. Hydra supports pop3, imap, and smtp modules; -f stops at the first hit. curl can also test a single POP3 credential and read messages once you have valid creds.",
