      "description": "Fast, recursive forced-browsing content-discovery tool written in Rust. Recurses into discovered directories by default (--depth caps it), making it strong at uncovering nested/unlinked directories and files. More of a forced-browser than a fuzzer like ffuf — point it at a base URL rather than a FUZZ keyword.",
