      "notes": "Recursion is ON by default (default depth 4) — use --depth to limit and -L/-t/--rate-limit to throttle. Filtering: -C filter-status, -S filter-size, -N filter-lines, -W filter-words; -s matches status codes; -x adds extensions. Complements ffuf-directory (ffuf is keyword-driven, feroxbuster auto-recurses). Also covered in OSCP web enumeration.",
