        "impact": "Full API schema enumeration without documentation access. IDOR to access other users' private data. Data extraction via unrestricted queries. Account modification or deletion via unrestricted mutations. DoS via query batching or deeply nested queries.",
        "detection": "[MITRE T1190] IDS: __schema or __type queries (introspection) from non-admin IPs. High-rate identical structure requests (batching). Query complexity > baseline. WAF: GraphQL-specific rules (introspection, aliased field abuse). Log: unusual field combinations in query bodies.",
