      "notes": "`unshadow /etc/passwd /etc/shadow > hashes` combines them into a john-crackable file. $6$=SHA-512, $y$=yescrypt. Needs root to read /etc/shadow.\nAlso covered in: OSCP PEN-200 Chapter 19 (Password Attacks)",
