        "impact": "Full interactive control of the host: enumeration, file access, pivoting, and post-ex modules.",
        "detection": "Meterpreter runs in memory (often injected into a host process), so detection focuses on the C2 channel (IDS signatures, beaconing) and behavioural EDR (an unexpected process making network connections and reflectively loaded code).",
        "artifacts": "An encrypted C2 connection; reflectively-loaded code in a host process; no meterpreter binary on disk.",
        "prevention": "Network IDS/EDR for Meterpreter C2 and reflective loading; egress filtering; application control to prevent the initial payload.",
