      "notes": "Default port 3306; `-p` takes NO space before the password. FILE privilege + an empty `secure_file_priv` is required for LOAD_FILE/INTO OUTFILE - modern MySQL restricts the write path. Hunt app creds inside the databases for reuse. Also covered in: OSCP PEN-200 Chapter 10 (SQL Injection Attacks).",
