      "id": "ad-nmap-host-list",
      "name": "nmap - Scan Host List from Discovery",
      "command": "sudo nmap -v -A -iL <hostfile> -oN <outfile>",
      "description": "Runs a comprehensive nmap scan against a list of live hosts (from fping). -A enables OS detection, version detection, script scanning, and traceroute. -iL reads targets from file. Output to file with -oN for reference. Identifies open services, OS versions, and initial AD infrastructure (DCs on 88/389/636/3268).",
