      "name": "Nmap - UDP Scan",
      "command": "sudo nmap <ip> -F -sU",
      "description": "UDP scan (-sU) is slow and often returns open|filtered because closed UDP ports reply with ICMP port-unreachable while open ones stay silent. --reason clarifies each verdict.",
