        "secure_config": "# Establish a vulnerability management program:\n# 1. Scan weekly with authenticated scans (Nessus/OpenVAS/Qualys)\n# 2. Integrate scan results with ticketing (Jira/ServiceNow)\n# 3. Set SLA by severity: Critical 72h, High 7d, Medium 30d\n# 4. Verify patches with re-scan\n\n# CVSS scoring -> risk-based prioritization:\n# Not all CVSSv3 9+ are exploitable in your environment\n# Use EPSS (Exploit Prediction Scoring System) to prioritize by actual exploitation likelihood\n\n# Defense-in-depth: patch is the fix, but compensating controls while patching:\n# WAF rule for web vuln CVEs\n# Network segment to isolate vulnerable service\n# IDS signature for exploit traffic"
