        "prerequisites": "WriteDACL (or GenericAll) over the domain object.",
        "impact": "Self-granted DCSync rights, enabling extraction of all domain hashes - domain compromise.",
        "detection": "[MITRE T1222.001] Event 5136 (DACL modified on the domain object, adding the replication GUIDs) by a non-DA; followed by 4662 replication (DCSync).",
        "artifacts": "A 5136 ACL change adding replication rights; the subsequent DCSync 4662.",
