        "prerequisites": "A position on the LAN segment.",
        "impact": "Reconnaissance of who is broadcasting what - targets for later poisoning - with no packets injected.",
        "detection": "Passive - Responder answers nothing, so there is little to detect; the underlying LLMNR/NBT-NS chatter is what enables it.",
