        "detection": "[MITRE T1557.001] LLMNR/NBT-NS/mDNS responses from an unexpected host (Responder); a sudden spoofed name-resolution answer; NetNTLM auth to an unknown host. Honeypot name-lookups (queries for non-existent hosts answered) reveal poisoning.",
