        "impact": "A complete attack-path graph (shortest paths to DA, ACL chains, delegation) - the roadmap for the whole domain compromise.",
        "detection": "[MITRE T1087.002] SharpHound's collection is distinctive: bulk LDAP queries (4662 / Defender for Identity recon alerts) PLUS SMB session enumeration across MANY hosts in a short window (a one-to-many fan-out); the .zip output.",
        "artifacts": "A collection .zip; mass LDAP + SMB session queries; SharpHound.exe execution.",
        "prevention": "Microsoft Defender for Identity flags SharpHound reconnaissance; monitor for LDAP+SMB fan-out; least privilege; the data is readable by design so detection is primary.",
        "evasion": "Stealth collection methods and throttling (--stealth, jitter, session-loop) reduce the fan-out signature; run in memory to avoid dropping the binary.",
