      "notes": "Banner-grab on 25/465/587. Enumerate users with VRFY/EXPN/RCPT TO (smtp-user-enum). Test for an open relay (mail from external to external). Valid usernames feed password spraying. Also covered in: OSCP PEN-200 Chapter 6 (Information Gathering).",
