        "prevention": "[MITRE T1090.001 M1030 Network Segmentation] strict east-west firewall rules so one foothold can't reach other segments; egress filtering; IDS/IPS + NetFlow analysis for proxy patterns and long-lived flows; alert on unexpected listeners on servers.",
