        "prerequisites": "An existing basic shell on the target with python or script available.",
        "impact": "A fully interactive TTY, greatly improving control over the session.",
        "detection": "Spawning of python pty.spawn / script in process and command logs (auditd / Sysmon 1); no additional network footprint (it reuses the existing shell).",
