      "notes": "Identify the DBMS (MySQL/MSSQL/PostgreSQL/Oracle) before crafting payloads - version()/@@version, comment syntax, and string concat all differ. `SELECT @@version` (MySQL/MSSQL) vs `version()` (Postgres) is the quickest tell. Also covered in: OSCP PEN-200 Chapter 10 (SQL Injection Attacks).",
