      "id": "sqli-detect",
      "name": "SQLi - Detect Injectable Input",
      "command": "'",
      "description": "Probe an input with characters that break SQL syntax to see if the query is unsanitized. A single quote is the classic test - a resulting DB error, blank page, or changed behaviour signals injection. In URLs, use the encoded forms.",
