      "notes": "Level 5 + risk 3 is the maximum coverage but slowest. Inspect the payloads SQLMap will send with -v 3 --level=5. Risk 3 OR-payloads can be destructive on UPDATE/DELETE endpoints. Also covered in: OSCP PEN-200 Chapter 10 (SQL Injection Attacks).",
