        "evasion": "Use `|map` instead of `|filter` if `filter` is blocked. Call alternative PHP functions (`passthru`, `shell_exec`, `popen`) to bypass function-name WAF rules. URL-encode pipe characters (%7C) and brackets to bypass naive string matching. Inject into non-obvious Twig contexts (email templates, PDF generation templates, logging sinks rendered via Twig).",
