        "impact": "Root privilege escalation via exploitable SUID binary (shell escapes, command injection, path abuse). Identifies the attack surface for further targeted exploitation.",
        "detection": "find command with -perm /4000 or -perm -4000 executed by non-root. SIEM: mass filesystem traversal for SUID files. Auditd: find -user root -perm -4000 by low-privileged user.",
