        "prevention": "Regularly audit SUID/SGID binaries: find / -perm /4000 -o -perm /2000. Remove SUID bit from all binaries where not operationally required. Keep SUID binaries patched. Use nosuid mount option on non-system partitions. Cross-reference SUID binaries against GTFOBins.",
