        "secure_config": "// Thick client authenticates to API only\n// API holds DB credentials and proxies queries\n// Client authenticates via OAuth2/SAML token\n\n// If credentials must be client-side, use DPAPI:\nbyte[] encrypted = ProtectedData.Protect(\n  Encoding.UTF8.GetBytes(secret), null,\n  DataProtectionScope.CurrentUser);",
