      "description": "Beats filters that validate the file type. Two checks exist: the Content-Type header (client-supplied, just change it) and the actual content via magic bytes (prepend an image signature). Prefixing the PHP shell with GIF8 makes mime_content_type see a GIF while PHP still executes the code.",
