      "description": "wenum is an actively-maintained fork of wfuzz, a flexible command-line fuzzer especially strong at parameter and value fuzzing. Substitute the FUZZ keyword anywhere in the URL (path, query value, POST body) and hide/show responses by code, words, or lines. wfuzz and wenum share identical syntax — swap the binary name freely.",
