        "why_it_works": "DISM is a Windows signed utility for managing Windows Features and images. /online targets the running OS (as opposed to an offline WIM). The TelnetClient optional feature is distributed as part of Windows but disabled by default. Enabling it installs telnet.exe in system32 without requiring a restart.",
