        "why_it_works": "php://filter/convert.base64-encode/resource=filename reads a file and base64-encodes its content. This is necessary for PHP source files that contain XML metacharacters (<, >, &) which would cause the XML parser to fail if included raw. Base64 encodes the content to safe ASCII, which the XML parser returns intact. The attacker decodes the base64 response to read the original file.",
